floor rect  18  41  25  43  flat 14   # V
floor rect  21  43  23  45  flat 14   # V
floor rect  21  45  23  47  ramp y 45 47 14 10   # V
floor rect  19  47  32  50  flat 10   # J
floor rect  23  50  26  51  flat 10   # J
floor rect  22  51  27  56  flat 10   # Z

